From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:21:32 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 183/297] Meridian: agents see and answer the page's own
 dialogs (handle_dialog)

list_tabs shows pending_dialog {type, message, buttons} for a tab whose page
shows (or, in the background, waits to show) an alert, confirm, prompt or
"Leave site?"; any page call into such a tab is an error at once saying so
(it hung before); handle_dialog accepts or dismisses it (prompt with its
text), with the person's OK in ask mode and not in read-only.
TabModalDialogManager tells what it shows (GetOpenDialog) and no longer
reads input from a dialog view that isn't there yet (a pending dialog).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
